(text "Power: U22 TPS7A2033 (3V3_AUDIO, EN tied to IN) and U23 TPS22917 (5V_CODEC for USB_Audio, CODEC_PWR_EN, QOD tied to VOUT, CT open)." (at 129.54 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "736d6588-b1ac-4dfa-b3e8-20a6b5c1f2f1"))
(text "PCM1862: I2C mode (MD0 low), address 0x4A (MS/AD low), I2S master from the 24.576 MHz crystal (512 fs, PLL off), SCKI grounded. VIN1 = USB, VIN2 = BT, VIN3 = AUX." (at 129.54 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e72ffc44-94bb-47c8-8ffa-d378627b6088"))
(text "Inputs: 2.2 uF - 100 R - 10 nF C0G (datasheet fig. 61 filter; ~5 mA ESD-diode limit). AVDD via FB200. No reset pin: firmware re-initialises after every 3V3_AUDIO enable." (at 129.54 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4ec01806-0dec-4bd9-ba94-e0f671c1173a"))
(text "Crystal CL 15 pF (Lucki L327S240P11L): 2 x 20 pF with about 3 pF stray gives about 13 pF; trim at bring-up. Spare VIN4, MICBIAS and GPIO0/2/3 are no-connect." (at 129.54 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f642ed46-0d9a-415e-ae52-7586f536d21f"))
)
